  "descriptionMarkdown": "An updated version of Nytromance Games’s plan, but actually functional: Correct underground pipe and belt lengths.\n\nCompletely repathed from the original. Insights are being produced here, as it is more efficient to do so. Significant Data is being produced elsewhere, as it is more efficient to use multiple insight types - I recommend the Astrophysics Simulation using EAM at this stage.\n\nPlease note the Stringweasel Valve on the Pressure Containment Data section.  If you do not use the Valves mod, you'll want to use a pump and wire it to maintain a non-full Cosmic Water level between the Thermodynamic Facilities - there is room built-in to do so.\n\nAlso note that Impact Shielding Data produces 1,500 scrap per cycle.  I build this just south of my Material 1 setup, so I fed the scrap ejection line into the existing scrap ejection line:   Just make sure you have enough recyclers to handle the flow, and consider adding a Storehouse as a buffer.\n\nFactorio 2.0, Krastorio 2, Space Exploration 0.7x, stringweasel’s Valves mod, and xkyouchoux’s Space Age Building Integration mods. Should be easy to adjust without the last two.\n",
